{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"faction_dailies/locales/kr/13010516/1.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010516:1:1","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/13010516/2.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010516:1:2","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/13010516/3.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010516:1:3","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/13010516/4.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010516:1:4","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/13010516/5.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010516:1:5","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/13010516/6.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010516:1:6","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/13010516/7.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010516:1:7","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/menus/13010516_1_6.kr.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_13010516:1:6","lang":"kr","texts":{"menu:6056680:1":{"text":"꾸륵꾸륵, 꾸르륵!","source_cn":"咕嘎咕嘎！嘎咕咕！","status":"exact_duplicate_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:等待的咕布林":{"text":"대기 중인 고블린","source":"等待的咕布林","status":"exact_hash"}}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222340.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222340","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322234001:1":{"text":"어젯밤 장원 북쪽에서 고블린의 울음소리가 들렸어요. 평소와는 다르게 매우 불안하고 부정적인 감정이 느껴졌어요.","source_cn":"昨夜我在庄园北部听到了咕布林的叫声，那情绪与以往不同，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16E7E5597DD4CB59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322234002:1":{"text":"아마도 놀라거나 무언가 곤란한 일이 있는 것 같아요.","source_cn":"也许他们被惊扰到了，也许正被什么困扰着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF94CF4C2CBA718B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322234003:1":{"text":"살아있는 시체와 마찰이 생기지 않도록 확인해주실 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"我害怕他们因此与活死人发生冲突，可以拜托你前去看看吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF4D642600136AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222350.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222350","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222350","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322235001:0":{"text":"보세요! 저기 설원 고블린이 있어요! 애처로운 울음소리를 들어보니 캐롤라이나가 말한 게 저들인 것 같아요. 어서 가봐요!","source_cn":"快看，是几只雪地咕布林！他们的叫声很凄厉，卡列琳娜说的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A22F2AF210964BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222360.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222360","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222360","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322236001:1":{"text":"그렇게 폭력적이지는 않네요. 뭔가 곤란한 일이 있는 것 같은데...","source_cn":"他们看起来并不是特别暴躁，更像是被什么困扰到了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x558AB1CD455DBC66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322236002:1":{"text":"길을 잃은 걸까요?","source_cn":"他们不会是迷路了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD1E98371AC0BDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322236003:1":{"text":"꾸륵! 꾸륵!","source_cn":"咕嘎！咕嘎咕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34DB8DBF64AD204E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322236004:1":{"text":"정말인 것 같네요... 길을 잃지 않도록 표식을 남겨두는 게 좋겠어요.","source_cn":"好像真的是……迷路的话，做个记号来防止再走错会比较好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF2E37E3AD7C1986","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322236005:1":{"text":"꾸륵! 꾸르르륵!","source_cn":"咕嘎！咕嘎嘎嘎咕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x530275A38C2E733D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322236006:1":{"text":"고블린이 땅에 있는 눈을 가리키고 있어요. 표식으로 눈사람을 만들어 보는 게 좋겠어요!","source_cn":"他们指向地上的雪，那就给他们堆个雪人来当记号吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AA61FF01D0FD697","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:迷路的咕布林":{"text":"길을 잃은 고블린","source":"迷路的咕布林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222370.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222370","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322237001:0":{"text":"눈사람을 다 만들었어요. 이제 고블린을 집으로 데려다 줘요!","source_cn":"雪人堆好了，现在送咕布林回家吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0735228B04DACDBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222380.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222380","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222380","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322238001:0":{"text":"역시 가족이 여기서 기다리고 있었어요!","source_cn":"果然有他们的家人等在这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF35AB7D35CD380ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222390.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222390","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222390","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322239001:0":{"text":"고블린 여러분! 어서 집으로 가세요. 또 길을 잃으면 안 돼요!","source_cn":"咕布林们回家吧，以后不要再迷路啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD914B6D92283911","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322239002:0":{"text":"꾸르르륵!","source_cn":"咕咕咕嘎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x535C87647D9F4F92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322239003:1":{"text":"꾸르르륵~","source_cn":"咕咕咕嘎——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5439051BF270062A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322239004:1":{"text":"고맙다고 하는 것 같아요!","source_cn":"他们好像在对我们说谢谢呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DAB20653F1D1D39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:等待的咕布林":{"text":"대기 중인 고블린","source":"等待的咕布林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:迷路的咕布林":{"text":"길을 잃은 고블린","source":"迷路的咕布林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":4}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222400.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222400","episode":"ep3","c